h the lid on.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nTransfer the chicken to a bowl again, leaving the sauce in the pan, and cover with foil to keep warm. Remove the yolks from the eggs and roughly chop the whites. Mash the egg yolks in a small bowl and gradually mix in a couple of tbsp of the sauce. Bring the remaining sauce to the boil to reduce a bit (you want it to just coat the chicken), then turn the heat down. Remove the bay and cinnamon stick. Add the egg yolks and cook for a few mins until the mixture has thickened. Stir in the almond mixture that you made earlier (this will thicken the sauce, too). Put the chicken back in the pan and heat it for about 3 mins, spooning the sauce over it. Season to taste.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nScatter over the extra parsley, the almonds pieces and the chopped egg whites (if youтАЩre going to use them). You can serve this straight from the dish with some rice, if you like.	1	\N	Spanish	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/pollo-en-pepitoria	mealdb:53162	[{"id": "e05629af-fc75-4076-881c-97d283038ce6", "name": "╨и╨░╤Д╤А╨░╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 0.5, "ingredientId": "f1effc80-8255-48f1-af11-683d65dbed62", "originalString": "0.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "355391ff-eb87-42ac-bcb4-7a87f4eddd26", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛ ╤Н╨║╤Б╤В╤А╨░ ╨▓╨╕╤А╨┤╨╢╨╕╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "8a574b37-ea99-457a-bf93-fef5c97a6eeb", "originalString": "60 ╨│"}, {"id": "f8c732d5-dba7-46bc-9a51-7f33c6d494ce", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "300 ╨│"}, {"id": "484ecb81-ab04-44ef-b4e2-a9517c426b55", "name": "╨Ь╨╕╨╜╨┤╨░╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "e2d86884-2548-43b1-90cc-fc741c8f32ca", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "f85a8bd2-cbe9-4b5f-876e-023456e344a6", "name": "╨з╨╡╤А╤Б╤В╨▓╤Л╨╣ ╤Е╨╗╨╡╨▒", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "abf05dd4-d838-463c-8a