ere тАУ if air bubbles form in the churros they can explode, especially if the oil overheats or you use old flour. Cooking with hot oil can be dangerous тАУ before you start, read up on how to deep-fry safely to avoid accidents in the kitchen. Keep children out of the kitchen and protect yourself by wearing long sleeves and eye protection, and keeping your face away from the pan.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nOnce the churros are crisp and golden brown, remove them from the oil with a slotted spoon and drain on the kitchen paper-lined tray. Carry on cooking the rest of the dough in batches, sprinkling the cooked churros with some cinnamon sugar as you go. When youтАЩve cooked all the churros, toss with any remaining cinnamon sugar and serve with the chocolate sauce, for dipping.\r\nTo see a video of how to prepare churros, take a look at our churros ice cream sandwich recipe.	1	\N	Spanish	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/churros-chocolate-dipping-sauce	mealdb:53153	[{"id": "ecfc78c8-9edf-445e-9cb7-f8cc177c80c2", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "8decf23b-ef98-4284-be44-a6ec5f06d66b", "name": "╨Т╨░╨╜╨╕╨╗╤М╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤Н╨║╤Б╤В╤А╨░╨║╤В", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "b614f73e-8060-4cfa-875b-64b6e12221ff", "originalString": "2.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "c1632890-aa75-42f2-9429-d00eb4fafad0", "name": "╨Я╤И╨╡╨╜╨╕╤З╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2633fb34-d4b3-48af-b379-e585510aa199", "name": "╨а╨░╨╖╤А╤Л╤Е╨╗╨╕╤В╨╡╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "972b3e3a-16f2-4ec2-b5e3-2bd543cca16d", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "9a677734-77db-4bba-8fc2-ca2a53a384c0", "name": "╨Я╨╛╨┤╤Б╨╛╨╗╨╜╨╡╤З╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 1000, "amount": 1000, "ingredientId": "9c0157c3-cccb-4325-8