well for about 1 min, until fragrant.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nStir in the chicken and let it cook for about 3-4 mins until beginning to brown all over. Follow with the French beans and stir well.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nSeason with the fish sauce and sugar, then add the rest of coconut milk. Mix well, add half the makrut lime leaves and simmer for 3-5 mins until the chicken is cooked through. Taste and add more sugar or fish sauce if necessary тАУ it should be salty and nutty, and the sweetness should come through. Add the Thai basil leaves, give it a quick mix and take off the heat. Serve with steamed jasmine rice, garnished with the sliced chilli and the rest of the makrut lime leaves.	1	\N	Thai	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/panang-chicken-curry-kaeng-panang-gai	mealdb:53192	[{"id": "4198cacd-a297-4024-912a-d2c66f895972", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╨║╨╛╤Б╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "5b412dd6-93d5-4ab2-92c1-3700bee8c60f", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "09243647-f4d3-490e-a0d0-828b5407f1aa", "name": "╨Я╨░╤Б╤В╨░ ╨║╨░╤А╤А╨╕ ╨┐╨░╨╜╨░╨╜╨│", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "357d8407-7be6-40d5-a0b1-ea33e1b9303a", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "f852c9ff-b61a-4612-9ed2-0ebff63651b7", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨╕╨╜╨░╤П ╨│╤А╤Г╨┤╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "12c12878-ea46-4858-9358-8795cf84fcbb", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "342ed9fd-b143-45c1-ac67-4c8a19e52fa4", "name": "╨б╤В╤А╤Г╤З╨║╨╛╨▓╨░╤П ╤Д╨░╤Б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2bc6a16c-84d4-4e39-afaf-85de693e2a64", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "0986a07f-df2d-40e4-8551-8191c4fc7a4c", "name": "╨а╤Л╨▒╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤Б╨╛╤Г╤Б", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91b70c2e-68d5-4936-81d3-a0eb5c94aec9", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "cf950ad0-910a-4011-b801-0eba12a525dc", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤З╨╜╨╡╨▓╤Л╨╣ ╤Б╨░╤Е╨░╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50,