 combine 1tsp garlic powder, paprika, cumin, onion powder, oregano, dried parsley, cayenne pepper (optional) mix and leave aside for fries.\r\n6\r\nSeason fries immediately once cooked and add salt to taste. Once the chicken is complete, serve immediately by laying out your flatbread, spreading the sauce evenly over the bread, add lettuce, onion, tomato, fries, chicken, feta and more sauce on top. Serve immediately.	1	\N	Saudi Arabian	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://cookpad.com/eng/recipes/24343467?ref=search&search_term=saudi+arabia	mealdb:53218	[{"id": "4dd62c5a-073c-43ab-98e1-78e135fcd6a8", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨╕╨╜╨░╤П ╨│╤А╤Г╨┤╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "12c12878-ea46-4858-9358-8795cf84fcbb", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "4fa39625-60ac-4766-b89e-56b3d64d13cd", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "c8a1cad4-6f9d-4a4b-9b89-a8bd1ae66c8f", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╤В╤Л╨╣ ╨║╨╛╤А╨╕╨░╨╜╨┤╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "65e800a3-46d5-42d2-8e85-55e428effea4", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "139c48f3-795e-40db-af29-f1766d0462aa", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╤В╤Л╨╣ ╤В╨╝╨╕╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 55, "amount": 55, "ingredientId": "0858e27e-aeba-4065-8384-85c4d4fc62a5", "originalString": "55 ╨│"}, {"id": "c11fbc74-709f-4d2d-bf81-b1e73a0603d2", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╤В╤Л╨╣ ╨║╨░╤А╨┤╨░╨╝╨╛╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c54f7fa0-7b18-4e80-bd35-1d2a96175056", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "29dbdba3-3839-43c0-b291-b84087ff38a0", "name": "╨Я╨╡╤А╨╡╤Ж ╨║╨░╨╣╨╡╨╜╤Б╨║╨╕╨╣", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "7cb60628-ad61-4cdb-b652-6e21ed928d1a", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "a98de758-e421-42f0-878f-16459fabac6d", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╨┐╤З╤С╨╜╨░╤П ╨┐╨░╨┐╤А╨╕╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "c5390c1c-eca3-401b-a5dd-5b8aa646a882", "originalSt