late ganache. Cool and pour on the Kunafa layer.\r\n9\r\nGarnish Pistachio Kunafa Chocolate Cake with chopped pistachio and silver balls. Keep in fridge for 2-3 hours. Then unmould the Kunafa Cake.\r\n10\r\nI also prepared Kunafa cupcakes. Cut and enjoy. The cake looked so pretty that we could either save it or have it!! тШ║\r\n11\r\nCross sectional view of the Pistachio Kunafa Chocolate Cake.\r\n12\r\nEnjoy with a new sweet delicacy this festive season with family and friends.	1	\N	Saudi Arabian	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://cookpad.com/eng/recipes/25116037?ref=search&search_term=saudi+arabia	mealdb:53224	[{"id": "6e4b2122-e158-4480-952f-8d8936f50ba2", "name": "╨С╨╡╨╗╤Л╨╣ ╤И╨╛╨║╨╛╨╗╨░╨┤", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 90, "amount": 90, "ingredientId": "f0eb6384-650c-480d-8553-7ce04cdaa5a0", "originalString": "90 ╨│"}, {"id": "bc8b9a2b-4105-43dc-b729-daf61a27e527", "name": "╨Э╨╡╤Б╨╛╨╗╤С╨╜╤Л╨╡ ╤Д╨╕╤Б╤В╨░╤И╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 240, "amount": 240, "ingredientId": "f380254d-89e8-4115-a69e-aadee4d88db6", "originalString": "240 ╨│"}, {"id": "bc69953b-0cee-4e92-8dcb-8bc4dac90307", "name": "╨б╨│╤Г╤Й╤С╨╜╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "51accafb-d839-4784-90fa-69e317021ee7", "originalString": "45 ╨│"}, {"id": "0a23979f-3ca4-43c0-90ed-f6116e261039", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 75, "amount": 75, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "75 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "9c6a4e75-97f7-4a33-bf78-6e527e58499e", "name": "╨Я╨╡╤Б╨╛╤З╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨┐╨╡╤З╨╡╨╜╤М╨╡ oreo", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 1250, "amount": 1250, "ingredientId": "461200af-5ff3-41b5-8618-dd65c5a73bb6", "originalString": "1250 ╨│"}, {"id": "422d4b34-bd99-41ff-8f8b-b153a14c0ab3", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 120, "amount": 120, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "120 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "3fc5ae3c-ba6a-46fc-8f27-2649aecb50ca", "name": "╨а╨░╨╖╤А╤Л╤Е╨╗╨╕╤В╨╡╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 2.5, 