ubble, turn the heat down to a gentle simmer. Press the rice down into the liquid if it isn't already submerged and place the chicken on top. Add the lemon wedges and olives around the chicken.\r\n\r\nCover and cook in the oven for 50 minutes. The rice should be cooked but still have some bite, and the chicken should have juices that run clear when pierced in the thickest part with a knife. If not, cook for another 5 minutes and check again.	1	\N	France	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.rivercottage.net/recipes/chicken-basquaise	mealdb:52934	[{"id": "17f254f7-77ba-40ac-8a3a-84fc3ad658dc", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fde4920d-1aea-40db-ab56-10941a2d8d85", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "1d2b0d1a-e454-48d8-b075-bad07db333e7", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "9933d95a-71f1-47cd-b4e6-83771a405bdd", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "300 ╨│"}, {"id": "d03eb6ad-1c1a-4ed3-a71c-de70f91b78b0", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨╗╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e90c3874-7702-443d-a509-8a57053c11cc", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "eea3b97a-b5aa-437d-aeb1-760b2ac35a20", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╤Ж", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "aaec9679-1d4f-42f6-a2c8-fcf86931215d", "name": "╨з╨╛╤А╨╕╨╖╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fdcea699-5c46-451c-8560-12484bf07b54", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "fb029cdf-3121-47d2-9398-573130c09761", "name": "╨Т╤П╨╗╨╡╨╜╤Л╨╡ ╤В╨╛╨╝╨░╤В╤Л", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "81f38095-cc2d-40b7-89e4-482d1e14aea1", "originalString": "400 ╨│"}, {"id": "a4c348f8-390e-