e. Cut lengthwise into fine strips, then crosswise into fine dice.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nPut the tomatoes, chillies, spring onions, finely chopped parsley, beef mince, spices, 1 tsp salt and ┬╜ tsp freshly ground black pepper into a bowl and mix well.\r\n\r\nstep 7\r\nTake the dough and knead it briefly, then divide into four pieces and shape each into a ball. Roll each ball into a thin circle, place on the prepared baking trays. Spread with a thin layer of the meat mixture.\r\n\r\nstep 8\r\nBake each flatbread for 10-15 mins until the edges begin to darken. After removing from the oven, sprinkle the lahmacun with the roughly chopped parsley and sliced onion, then squeeze over a few drops of lemon juice. Serve straightaway.	1	\N	Vietnamese	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/lahmacun	mealdb:53251	[{"id": "42b79e50-b604-4e09-a303-19528280c24c", "name": "╨Я╤И╨╡╨╜╨╕╤З╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "9ee5e5f8-89c3-4d21-90b1-8a32d04cacce", "name": "╨С╤Л╤Б╤В╤А╨░╤П ╨┤╤А╨╛╨╢╨╢╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0b214cdb-c1f8-436f-b23c-a2e81cd5c554", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "ca379cbd-51f8-41b5-82d2-0fa7ed05f3e1", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╨║╤Г╤А╤Г╨╖╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨║╤А╨░╤Е╨╝╨░╨╗", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "41137d44-eccd-4d8e-b985-ca171a3b3a50", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "740239d6-db7b-44bb-b4af-a499350913a3", "name": "╨Я╨╛╨╝╨╕╨┤╨╛╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "45cb2ba3-2e43-4595-a7da-c2e80b7ee571", "name": "╨Ч╨╡╨╗╨╡╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤З╨╕╨╗╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "6f442e35-3675-4ed0-a779-b94ab057e10a", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "cfb22174-fd73-48db-b21e-028d7b5982d7", "name": "╨Ч╨╡╨╗╨╡╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨╗╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingre