, add the pasta and cook for 12-14 minutes (or according to the instructions on the packet), until al dente. Meanwhile, reheat the sauce. Drain the pasta, return it to the pot, stir in a tablespoon of oil, then divide between the bowls. \r\n\r\nPut all the pesto ingredients except the basil in the small bowl of a food processor. Add a tablespoon of water and blitz to a rough paste. Add the basil, then blitz until just combined (the pesto has a much better texture if the basil is not overblended).\r\n\r\nSpoon over the rag├╣ and top with a spoonful of pesto. Finish with a sprinkling of chopped fennel fronds, if you have any, and serve at once.	1	\N	Italian	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	http://www.ottolenghi.co.uk/recipes/meat/rigatoni-with-fennel-sausage-sauce-and-pecorino-and-anchovy-pesto-shop	mealdb:52783	[{"id": "0b631ed7-a00c-4256-b78b-f1a3fb260a78", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "100 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "162fbe56-0078-4b5c-bec8-54d756123e97", "name": "╨Ш╤В╨░╨╗╤М╤П╨╜╤Б╨║╨░╤П ╨║╨╛╨╗╨▒╨░╤Б╨░ ╨╕╨╖ ╤Д╨╡╨╜╤Е╨╡╨╗╤П", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "6d9fe7dc-ccb2-4dc5-9030-32c9fdbbd88b", "originalString": "300 ╨│"}, {"id": "7f0448ac-c227-4441-b7ca-520fcc9315b8", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "ed87c71c-cb74-47e4-b453-71389a569cec", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║╨╛╨▓╨╕╤Ж╨░ ╤Д╨╡╨╜╤Е╨╡╨╗╤П", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "068d8f0b-19ae-4a82-b84d-5b14286027cb", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "32077963-0106-481b-a243-d2e3d1bfc56f", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╨┐╤З╨╡╨╜╨░╤П ╨┐╨░╨┐╤А╨╕╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "dafb48c5-68db-4efe-8416-648d23d829db", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "bc936fa2-2fdb-4a45-8121-31f592e9d075", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 10