 slightly taste the tofu and add pinch of salt if not salty enough. By the way, if you feel it is too spicy, add some sugar can milder the taste. But be carefully as the broth is very hot at this point.\r\nTransfer out when almost all the seasonings stick to tofu cubes. Sprinkle Szechuan peppercorn powder (to taste)and chopped garlic greens if using.\r\nServe immediately with steamed rice.	1	\N	Chinese	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.chinasichuanfood.com/mapo-tofu-recipe/	mealdb:52947	[{"id": "07d3e57f-0e47-46f5-acbc-074dabdfc897", "name": "╨в╨╛╤Д╤Г", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "18e49178-2d0c-454f-bb2a-e680c6c3acc2", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "79895ab5-aff7-424b-a167-603ab24eb9f9", "name": "╨У╨╛╨▓╤П╨╢╨╕╨╣ ╤Д╨░╤А╤И", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "15229283-665a-43f5-8bb0-69faf5749d2f", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "f065368f-b41d-40b5-bcff-eca6b1e9af33", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╨╜╨╢╤Г╤В╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "b9cc0a95-6c86-4934-8f21-aa79d1153073", "originalString": "25 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "67adbbb5-9801-4085-9426-8fb4eabf7793", "name": "Doubanjiang", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 7.5, "amount": 7.5, "ingredientId": "1bb0718a-ad6d-4fe2-b0ba-e545dfb2a57e", "originalString": "7.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "5a377684-8e54-4a22-b3a1-8c36794b4aa1", "name": "╨д╨╡╤А╨╝╨╡╨╜╤В╨╕╤А╨╛╨▓╨░╨╜╨╜╨░╤П ╤З╨╡╤А╨╜╨░╤П ╤Д╨░╤Б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "11f3cded-a57b-4197-be87-c4fe0c08e9fa", "originalString": "2.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "3b7ba100-9961-488b-af61-f6d51dfc3cc6", "name": "╨Я╨╡╤А╨╡╤Ж", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "d3dfb0aa-eee1-4b65-ab07-c5a515878c08", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "2.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "04c74486-8d0b-4710-9c6e-be5cf5b3e1d5", "name": "╨б╤Л╤З╤Г╨░