d well risen but cooked through.\r\nLeave to cool, then run a knife around the edge of each dish and remove the souffl├йs. If preparing in advance, place souffl├йs upside down (for neat presentation), on a tray. Cover tray in cling film. Chill for a few days or freeze for up to 1 month.\r\nWhen ready to re-bake, heat oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Place the upside-down souffl├йs in a shallow baking dish, top with the remaining goatтАЩs cheese slices and pour over the cream (this stops them from drying out when baked for the second time). Cook for 8-10 mins until golden. Serve immediately alongside some simply dressed salad.	1	\N	France	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/3028701/threecheese-souffls	mealdb:52912	[{"id": "7a383dc1-8be7-46ad-ae95-c15b13d3461c", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "095326c7-9789-4e4b-ae8f-238191089a21", "name": "╨Я╨░╤А╨╝╨╡╨╕╨║╨░╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "041e629c-7e02-4a03-830e-e52ee3f32d5f", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "5d7269c1-2f92-4211-a618-1dc1fac00430", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "1a8396a4-9ca5-4785-a87f-19597228c67f", "name": "╨Ы╨░╨▓╤А╨╛╨▓╤Л╨╣ ╨╗╨╕╤Б╤В", "unit": "╤И╤В", "grams": 50, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "74796ff2-897a-4931-9396-b51b81fda780", "originalString": "1 ╤И╤В"}, {"id": "2e397507-f789-4c1f-a95b-320d8a0a3c09", "name": "╨Я╤И╨╡╨╜╨╕╤З╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "250 ╨│"}, {"id": "d5c038dc-5781-47c6-8db8-8b6ca2a4c209", "name": "╨Р╨╜╨│╨╗╨╕╨╣╤Б╨║╨░╤П ╨│╨╛╤А╤З╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "594b2b5e-f9e5-4cb2-85b5-e1a5bcf43807", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "1c789936-7169-4b3