spoon dipped in cold water to shape each raspeball in your hand. Try to make them as smooth as possible and then gently drop them into the simmering broth. Dip the tablespoon in a bowl of cold water between each raspeball.\r\nтЦв\r\nLet the raspeballer simmer for about 30 minutes. If you're making smoked sausage, you can heat the sausage in the same pot with the raspeballer. Top with fresh chopped parsley.\r\n\r\nMashed Rutabaga\r\nтЦв\r\nPeel the rutabaga and carrots and cut into small pieces. Boil in water for about 30 minutes, or until tender. Then drain the water, add the cream/milk, butter and nutmeg and mash until smooth.\r\nтЦв\r\nServe alongside the raspeballer and meat.	1	\N	Norway	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://scandinaviancookbook.com/raspeballer-norwegian-potato-dumplings/	mealdb:53124	[{"id": "12fd2e17-db08-45ad-9585-be280c58c7e1", "name": "╨б╨▓╨╕╨╜╨╕╨╜╨░ (╤А╤Г╨╗╤М╨║╨░)", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "99149b3b-47d5-4c4b-86cf-a4961241d50c", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "ed181a39-8004-4691-b345-4ba7e3e58102", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╨╗╨▒╨░╤Б╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a63f6d5d-5fb2-49b7-b04c-e3d1bc3feaac", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "e2fb9815-0690-45f5-b814-036c08a38c17", "name": "╨Ъ╨░╤А╤В╨╛╤Д╨╡╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "d04f3435-1d90-4a4f-b1cb-a00474a0b4d9", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨║╨░╤А╤В╨╛╤Д╨╡╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "76270a4a-43a6-45ad-adc8-36a3964ef185", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "8002c911-ba49-4679-aa61-62868c06bb00", "name": "╨Ь╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "300 ╨│"}, {"id": "a7fb12ac-d063-456f-9a53-7d9bb5a82968", "name": "╨г╨╜╨╕╨▓╨╡╤А╤Б╨░╨╗╤М╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "58017ffe-5af2-