n a third full) over a medium-high heat and fry the dumplings for 3-5 mins until golden brown. Use a slotted spoon or spider to turn them, then cover with a lid and cook for another 3-4 mins until golden. Remove the lid and cook for 1-2 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nMeanwhile, combine all the dipping sauce ingredients in small bowl. Serve the dumplings with the dipping sauce on the side.	1	\N	Vietnamese	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/rice-paper-dumplings	mealdb:53227	[{"id": "89dbd8c1-5cc8-4ff4-bbee-a2a35d199996", "name": "╨С╨╡╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛╤З╨░╨╜╨╜╨░╤П ╨║╨░╨┐╤Г╤Б╤В╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 12.5, "amount": 12.5, "ingredientId": "51fdab97-c634-43ea-99f0-ccb66571ba38", "originalString": "12.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "98b4697a-0cde-4f62-aa0e-5fa3ceb32364", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╤А╨║╨╛╨▓╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "0826c2ee-8321-427f-a960-4540c7ca0e30", "name": "╨У╤А╨╕╨▒╤Л ╤И╨╕╤В╨░╨║╨╡", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "31c70a77-6089-4487-ba45-01e5ccd31fc4", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "3fad80c9-40a0-4365-94c9-67b256b5dc6c", "name": "╨б╨▓╨╕╨╜╨╛╨╣ ╤Д╨░╤А╤И", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4a8617c8-c6dc-48dc-b789-6aa0e9d0ae6b", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "22535ef6-a135-4043-a031-7e353a479d84", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "3472821d-1ad7-460f-bedb-f53f411a748e", "name": "╨Ш╨╝╨▒╨╕╤А╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "99bbf6a6-efe3-4c2e-aa4b-295ff44f4ddb", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╡╨▓╤Л╨╣ ╤Б╨╛╤Г╤Б", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 40, "amount": 40, "ingredientId": "f4b21455-e4d4-4a4c-8406-5f5b1519b201", "originalString": "40 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "8893ca93-01d2-4171-810d-6b2a83010912", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛ ╨║╤Г