ge, deep pan ensuring it is no more than a third full and heat to 170C, or until a cube of bread browns lightly in 30 seconds. Fry the croquetas in batches for 2-3 mins until deeply golden. To cook from frozen, fry at 160C for a few minutes longer until theyтАЩre piping hot inside. Remove to a sheet of kitchen paper using a slotted spoon and leave to drain. Serve warm with a glass of sherry.	1	\N	Spanish	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/jamon-wild-garlic-croquetas	mealdb:53145	[{"id": "22580b2c-ffc9-475d-87b2-fdba39b38298", "name": "╨Ф╨╕╨║╨╕╨╣ ╤З╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cc76425f-d060-4cd1-9a4b-22b642b7a2d5", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "3c169a09-0667-4325-bc75-febf77c8c0a1", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "5bdeb6b9-ad9b-4141-a256-ed8876d7ffb9", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "e834fa09-427c-4692-a055-8be992829584", "name": "╨Ь╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "1bd7f3a5-8c6c-4329-971f-55e3f635e9c0", "name": "╨Ь╨░╨╜╤З╨╡╨│╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3a72b249-32cb-46a2-9cab-7a9778bea1ab", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "9a3b2c58-5e7d-4bc2-be7c-c178b976d328", "name": "╨Ш╨▒╨╡╤А╨╕╨╣╤Б╨║╨╛╨╡ ╨▓╨░╤А╨╡╨╜╤М╨╡", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "83646322-2dc9-47ee-9683-5bc82116ca6d", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "26a6f611-22d3-40e6-a90b-50d5635791da", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨╛", "unit": "╤И╤В", "grams": 2500, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "50 ╤И╤В"}, {"id": "9d571d65-3e02-4dbd-8cfc-e24b7ba9d622", "name": "╨Я╨░╨╜╨╕╤А╨╛