 until the fish has heated through.\r\n\r\nGently stir in almost all the 3 tbsp chopped fresh parsley, and season with a little salt and black pepper to taste. Serve scattered with the remaining parsley and garnished with 1 lemon, cut into wedges.	1	\N	India	["╨╖╨░╨▓╤В╤А╨░╨║"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/2256/smoked-haddock-kedgeree	mealdb:52964	[{"id": "ba15f5c0-6ed8-4d73-b894-ce8b099ba246", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "f6e012d4-5c31-470b-b5c2-bde9eda3574e", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "13a26ccc-964e-4f06-99fe-0555144e594f", "name": "╨Ъ╨░╤А╨┤╨░╨╝╨╛╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "5dd52155-0745-4004-84dd-6ef596f58f82", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "3f230837-a505-4783-b2ff-b20b0199e2ce", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨║╤Г╨╝╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 1.3, "amount": 1.3, "ingredientId": "e9900362-e715-4c27-a1a7-e7f4837aec69", "originalString": "1.3 ╨│"}, {"id": "57bb0039-994c-4718-8c6d-cef7c228c71f", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2c622840-cbf4-48e4-bfd3-3f6980be4e72", "name": "╨Ы╨░╨▓╤А╨╛╨▓╤Л╨╣ ╨╗╨╕╤Б╤В", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "74796ff2-897a-4931-9396-b51b81fda780", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "ae2e17d6-4a80-4881-be47-f643aeb665f2", "name": "╨а╨╕╤Б ╨▒╨░╤Б╨╝╨░╤В╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "73161a81-741b-4518-ae40-ac98332a299b", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "18387574-1bbd-43e2-b9fa-97745421c26f", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨╕╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨▒╤Г╨╗╤М╨╛╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 1000, "amount": 1000, "ingredientId": "91e363d7-dd45-4ec9-9fec-998b79337f1d", "originalString": "1000 ╨│"}, {"id": "1a2b1cd2-f9fe-40c5