of the omelet batter. Egg foo young should immediately bubble and puff up like magic. Fry until golden brown and crispy on each side, about 2 minutes per side. If there are any light spots, use a ladle to gently baste it with hot oil.\r\n\r\nTip\r\nEgg foo young can be a bit tricky to flip. The easiest method is to put a tool in each hand (a spider, slotted spoon, tongs, and large chopsticks are all good candidates) and gently coax the omelet over, pulling up on one side and pushing down and around on the other.\r\n\r\nRemove the omelet and place it on a paper towel-lined baking sheet. Let it cool for 5 minutes. Meanwhile, repeat with the remaining batter to make 4 omelets. If needed, add more oil to the pan between batches.\r\n\r\nServe and enjoy:\r\nPlate each egg foo young over a bed of rice. Spoon the warm gravy over the top and serve immediately.	1	\N	Chinese	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.simplyrecipes.com/egg-foo-young-recipe-6890222	mealdb:53370	[{"id": "c6964151-c3ce-4408-ba2f-2b2b17f94744", "name": "╨У╨╛╨▓╤П╨╢╨╕╨╣ ╨▒╤Г╨╗╤М╨╛╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 240, "amount": 240, "ingredientId": "e4abe98d-da0e-4159-8aed-2ce633951fc1", "originalString": "240 ╨│"}, {"id": "88019a68-42f7-42fe-a95a-6b3330b890bf", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╡╨▓╤Л╨╣ ╤Б╨╛╤Г╤Б", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "f4b21455-e4d4-4a4c-8406-5f5b1519b201", "originalString": "15 ╨│"}, {"id": "8944ebfb-5780-492f-91b5-cbf347c51aaf", "name": "╨Т╨╕╨╜╨╛ ╤И╨░╨╛╤Б╨╕╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "3cca0fb9-227f-4600-8a7b-41945b509348", "originalString": "15 ╨│"}, {"id": "daef41c6-1032-4e6a-9bc0-f8ce28ced7fc", "name": "╨б╨╛╤Г╤Б ╤Г╤Б╤В╤А╨╕╤З╨╜╤Л╨╣", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "be12e1e3-9616-4b41-bfea-fc264c225673", "originalString": "15 ╨│"}, {"id": "bc189127-10f5-4e04-9f54-2069f43dee5b", "name": "╨Я╨╡╤А╨╡╤Ж", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "2.5 ╨│"}, {"i