e with one point of the square facing you (like a diamond). Place about 1/4 cup of the egg roll filling mixture in the middle of the wrapper.\r\n\r\nDip your fingers in water and run around the edges of the wrapper. Then fold the edges of the wrapper over the center and start rolling the egg roll away from you to form a tight cylinder. Place on a plate and repeat until you are out of filling. You should get at least a dozen egg rolls.\r\n\r\nAir fry the egg rolls:\r\nPlace the egg rolls in the basket of your air fryer. Spray or brush them lightly with oil. Add as many as you can without stacking the egg rolls, making sure they donтАЩt touch. Air needs to circulate around them. Brush the egg rolls lightly with oil.\r\n\r\nPlace the basket in the air fryer and turn the air fryer to 350┬░F. Cook for 6 to 7 minutes, then flip the egg rolls, spray or brush with oil a second time on the bottom side, and cook for another 4 to 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nFinished egg rolls should be golden brown and crispy! Serve immediately.	1	\N	Chinese	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/air_fryer_chinese_egg_rolls/	mealdb:53373	[{"id": "8d80d17e-6525-4b2c-9a43-ae467c22d66d", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "15 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "21b95ce2-384a-4532-a259-434394182dd4", "name": "╨б╨▓╨╕╨╜╨╕╨╜╨░ (╨╝╨╛╨╗╨╛╤В╨░╤П)", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "71312c16-d928-433c-a484-5696ff1e83c4", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "5a34e506-ab66-4c74-bcb0-6377f3541731", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "63a65d46-fdda-4071-8bff-57c6618894f8", "name": "╨Ш╨╝╨▒╨╕╤А╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "15 ╨│"}, {"id": "11839c85-da26-4f66-9903-f9fe7