e, grill or barbecue for 3 mins on each side or until the fat is nicely browned, then put in a serving dish and squeeze over the lemon halves. Scatter the aubergines with parsley, then serve with the lamb and tzatziki.	1	\N	Turkish	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/imam-bayildi-bbq-lamb-tzatziki	mealdb:53253	[{"id": "88ffaac9-a123-4c31-a460-da2e46f73c52", "name": "╨С╨░╨║╨╗╨░╨╢╨░╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "2abb6236-93df-48a2-8005-fbea3b142357", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "d4168823-9249-4a93-9596-61827982165a", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "30 ╨│"}, {"id": "fabe20fc-801e-4558-a8f6-7ee7f6f5383d", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "1fade550-ee9c-400e-93ac-749b25e7bd11", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "e0f652d7-c176-4ec5-a5cd-0d267d8e1ffd", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "892cfbfc-e180-4c35-b3c6-f15e0a16d2d1", "name": "╨Я╨╛╨╝╨╕╨┤╨╛╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "400 ╨│"}, {"id": "d6db4d54-9484-4dc4-9f1e-c759f20e3349", "name": "╨Я╨╡╤В╤А╤Г╤И╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6f6bca24-b7e6-4c6a-9f84-86fb3e2c9dcd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "a8a5bf8d-e637-4da8-a845-074f6a614682", "name": "╨С╨░╤А╨░╨╜╨╕╨╜╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 600, "amount": 600, "ingredientId": "592dc5ae-f7ea-4cb8-b6db-bb6600636bd4", "originalString": "600 ╨│"}, {"id": "97ebf082-3365-450b-8e10-be62a5955315", "name": "╨Я╨░╨┐╤А╨╕╨║╨░