ant half with 1 tablespoon oil, letting each brushstroke be fully absorbed before brushing with more. Season with salt and pepper. Place a rosemary sprig on top of each one. Transfer to oven and roast until completely tender and well charred, 25 to 35 minutes. Remove from oven and discard rosemary.\r\n\r\n3.\r\nTo Serve: Heat 2 tablespoons olive oil and pine nuts in a medium skillet set over medium heat. Cook, tossing nuts frequently, until golden brown and aromatic, about 4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl to halt cooking. Stir half of parsley and rosemary into lentils and transfer to a serving platter. Arrange eggplant halves on top. Spread a few tablespoons of tahini sauce over each eggplant half and sprinkle with pine nuts. Sprinkle with remaining parsley and rosemary, drizzle with additional olive oil, and serve.	1	\N	United States	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	http://www.seriouseats.com/recipes/2016/03/roasted-eggplant-tahini-pine-nut-lentil-vegan-experience-recipe.html	mealdb:52816	[{"id": "b085a134-218f-40df-a991-2b9dd7e20e66", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "30 ╨│"}, {"id": "2207406b-b888-4a25-a015-d7c24ac75b8e", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╤А╨║╨╛╨▓╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "628149d8-6feb-48fe-a05d-d1a60aee1728", "name": "╨б╨╡╨╗╤М╨┤╨╡╤А╨╡╨╣", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "a4b7203e-cf47-4297-8829-4be3c7270d19", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "0721914e-fbe7-4d62-9edb-8ab0373ab65a", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "456000bd-3fcd-4191-b677-274f40d811c4", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "300 ╨│"}, {"id": 