d oregano. Next add the can of tomatoes, the water or stock, and carrots. Let simmer, covered, for 20 minutes or until the veg is tender and the mixture has thickened up. YouтАЩll need to check on the pot periodically for a stir and a top of of liquid if needed.\r\nAdd the lentils and chopped roasted squash. Let cook for 10 more minutes to heat through.\r\nServe with sliced jalapeno, lime wedges, cilantro, green onions, and cashew sour cream.\r\n\r\nSIMPLE CASHEW SOUR CREAM\r\n\r\n1 Cup Raw Unsalted Cashews\r\nPinch Sea Salt\r\n1 tsp. Apple Cider Vinegar\r\nWater\r\n\r\nBring some water to the boil, and use it to soak the cashews for at least four hours. Alternatively, you can use cold water and let the cashews soak overnight, but IтАЩm forgetful/lazy, so often use the boil method which is much faster.\r\nAfter the cashews have soaked, drain them and add to a high speed blender. Begin to puree, slowly adding about 1/2 cup fresh water, until a creamy consistency is reached. You may need to add less or more water to reach the desired consistency.\r\nAdd a pinch of sea salt and vinegar (or lemon juice).	1	\N	British	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	http://www.wholeheartedeats.com/2016/11/smoky-lentil-chili-squash/	mealdb:52784	[{"id": "63b508e4-967b-44ea-a145-49971bf6e5f2", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "64ddb963-b22c-4017-91a4-8fd9d6165e50", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "9770d742-9837-46d8-9038-e0996c6c947b", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║-╨┐╨╛╤А╨╡╨╣", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "7c3f95ba-19e8-40ba-bae6-641396ab35a4", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "ef1b3a95-74cf-4298-b3b9-31e916fa0b9f", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62",