aac877c9-2bb2-49fa-b409-72b9445e4a88	╨п╨╕╤З╨╜╨╕╤Ж╨░ ╤Б ╤В╤А╨╡╤Б╨║╨╛╨╣ ╨╕ ╨║╨░╤А╤В╨╛╤Д╨╡╨╗╨╡╨╝	lunch	1002	55	31	125	{╨╗╨░╨║╤В╨╛╨╖╨░,╨╝╨╛╤А╨╡╨┐╤А╨╛╨┤╤Г╨║╤В╤Л,╤П╨╣╤Ж╨░,╤А╤Л╨▒╨░}	[{"name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "grams": 60}, {"name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨Ъ╨░╤А╤В╨╛╤Д╨╡╨╗╤М ╨┤╨╢╨╡╤А╤Б╨╕ ╤А╨╛╤П╨╗", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "grams": 100}, {"name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨╛", "grams": 1000}, {"name": "╨Я╨╡╤В╤А╤Г╤И╨║╨░", "grams": 125}, {"name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М ╤В╤А╨╡╤Б╨║╨░", "grams": 50}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/njj1681763297231.jpg	2026-05-03 20:15:23.412+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.338+00	[]	step 1\r\nHeat half the oil in a frying pan, and saut├й the onion over a medium heat until soft and pale gold тАУ this will take about 8 mins. Remove from the pan, set aside, and add the potatoes to the pan. Cook until they are tender but not falling apart, carefully turning every so often. Cover the pan some of the time to help the slices cook through. Add the onions back to the pan along with the garlic and cook for another 4 mins. Tip into a bowl with the eggs, parsley and some seasoning and mix together. Leave to sit for half an hour.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, put the cod in a saucepan and cover with water. Bring up to a simmer. Remove from the heat, cover and leave for 10 mins. Drain, leave to cool and remove the skin and any bones. Break into large flakes and add to the potato and egg mixture.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nHeat the rest of the oil in a non-stick frying pan. Pour in the tortilla mix and cook over a medium-low heat until it is just set and coming away from the sides of the pan. You might need to cover it to help the centre set. Be careful not to overcook it. Put a spatula underneath the tortilla every so often to make sure it isnтАЩt sticking. Slide the tortilla onto a plate, then put the pan on top and flip the tortilla into it, uncooked side-down. Cook over a low heat until golden, or grill until just set. Leave to cool a little before serving.	1	\N	Spanish	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/salt-cod-tortilla	mealdb:53171	[{"id": "81a12b23-a508-4912-87da-27679f47a3e4", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "60 ╨│"}, {"id": "e9e5b9bd-8c99-4253-9dd7-fd88dbc58f3d", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "b548ce2d-636f-4cc1-855b-1544326f4663", "name": "╨Ъ╨░╤А╤В╨╛╤Д╨╡╨╗╤М ╨┤╨╢╨╡╤А╤Б╨╕ ╤А╨╛╤П╨╗", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "672fa777-04e8-48ed-9b0e-c256fd6c675f", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "bdb29c6f-1685-49c5-af8e-32d9be092365", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "0b65a604-6aef-4cce-98e0-7069c72488d1", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨╛", "unit": "╤И╤В", "grams": 1000, "amount": 20, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "20 ╤И╤В"}, {"id": "3c4cf6cb-4c3f-42be-925a-fb18d5e7135e", "name": "╨Я╨╡╤В╤А╤Г╤И╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 125, "amount": 125, "ingredientId": "6f6bca24-b7e6-4c6a-9f84-86fb3e2c9dcd", "originalString": "125 ╨│"}, {"id": "6ab6ba70-de74-4b46-bc28-15b55104b7ee", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М ╤В╤А╨╡╤Б╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "ab3b96ad-370b-4211-88f1-8cc1ced037d6", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}]	["vegetarian", "lactose-free"]
4ee0ec2b-484e-46c7-a177-7d6f2e75b847	╨а╤Л╨▒╨░ ╨▓ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨░╨╗╨╡	lunch	2598	143	81	325	{╤А╤Л╨▒╨░}	[{"name": "╨б╨║╤Г╨╝╨▒╤А╨╕╤П", "grams": 200}, {"name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤З╨╕╨╗╨╕", "grams": 900}, {"name": "╨Ш╨╝╨▒╨╕╤А╤М", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "grams": 400}, {"name": "╨Я╨╡╤А╨╡╤Ж", "grams": 7.5}, {"name": "╨в╨╝╨╕╨╜", "grams": 5}, {"name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨║╤Г╨╝╨░", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨У╨▓╨╛╨╖╨┤╨╕╨║╨░", "grams": 200}, {"name": "╨Ъ╨░╤А╨┤╨░╨╝╨╛╨╜", "grams": 100}, {"name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А", "grams": 15}, {"name": "╨в╨░╨╝╨░╤А╨╕╨╜╨┤", "grams": 100}, {"name": "╨г╨║╤Б╤Г╤Б", "grams": 37.5}, {"name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "grams": 50}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uwxusv1487344500.jpg	2026-05-03 20:15:22.316+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.34+00	[]	Soak all the spices, ginger, garlic, tamarind pulp and kashmiri chilies except oil in vinegar.\r\nAdd sugar and salt.\r\nAlso add turmeric powder.\r\nCombine all nicely and marinate for 35-40 mins.\r\nGrind the mixture until soft and smooth. Add more vinegar if required but ensure the paste has to be thick so add vinegar accordingly. If the masala paste is thin then it would not stick to the fish.\r\nRinse the fish slit from the center and give some incision from the top. You could see the fish below for clarity.\r\nNow stuff the paste into the center and into the incision. Coat the entire fish with this paste. Marinate the fish for 30 mins.\r\nPlace oil in a shallow pan, once oil is quite hot shallow fry the stuffed mackerels.\r\nFry until golden brown from both sides\r\nServe the recheado mackerels hot with salad, lime wedges, rice and curry.\r\nNotes\r\n1. Ensure the masala paste is thick else the result won't be good.\r\n2. If you aren't able to find kashmiri chilies then use bedgi chilies or kashmiri red chili powder.\r\n3. You could use white vinegar or coconut vinegar.\r\n4. Any left over paste could be stored in the fridge for future use.\r\n5. Cinnamon could be avoided as it's a strong spice used generally for meat or chicken.	1	\N	India	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	http://www.flavorsofmumbai.com/fish-recheado-masala-recipe/	mealdb:52809	[{"id": "80a9befd-cdd2-4301-9d94-21ceae608adb", "name": "╨б╨║╤Г╨╝╨▒╤А╨╕╤П", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "f88346ba-8e56-451b-a6e4-87fd213173a0", "originalString": "200 ╨│"}, {"id": "4ab6053a-0170-4055-8b16-5c8a1da0811f", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤З╨╕╨╗╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 900, "amount": 900, "ingredientId": "1bdf28f1-5237-485b-956d-fc1a25d21656", "originalString": "900 ╨│"}, {"id": "7f7b543a-4129-40d8-9aa3-5d55c1fbcd2f", "name": "╨Ш╨╝╨▒╨╕╤А╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "78188ace-5551-4654-9ea2-f752ce3574b4", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "400 ╨│"}, {"id": "c4f6f541-48bc-429b-bf2a-6edca9f097af", "name": "╨Я╨╡╤А╨╡╤Ж", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 7.5, "amount": 7.5, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "7.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "6ba7c377-bcbb-4613-ac7f-ce8e98588ef1", "name": "╨в╨╝╨╕╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "d3ebda74-17c3-45b6-8ddd-82a44f0d652e", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "3bcffc1e-86c0-43af-abb6-0fba166a36b0", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨║╤Г╨╝╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e9900362-e715-4c27-a1a7-e7f4837aec69", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2d3235fc-c510-466d-88c2-a73e17d1f11c", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "46ecf006-4282-4956-9f94-9049ca08235b", "name": "╨У╨▓╨╛╨╖╨┤╨╕╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "dfbbaba4-1f1d-40e2-949c-06b7a6a78217", "originalString": "200 ╨│"}, {"id": "f641cee4-448f-45ce-be6b-039200fac941", "name": "╨Ъ╨░╤А╨┤