op in a small chunk of bread. The oil is ready when it browns in about 30 secs. Add the doughnuts and fry, turning them once for about 1-2 mins on each side (a thin lighter ring should form in the middle). After removing, drain the doughnuts of excess fat on some kitchen paper.	1	\N	Polish	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/polish-doughnuts	mealdb:53298	[{"id": "93c86100-5b61-46cc-aa5f-ce9ad7dddd08", "name": "╨Ф╤А╨╛╨╢╨╢╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8173f05b-53c4-4ba6-a714-740bc2534450", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2dc74cbc-c6f3-4ee6-8ab6-b58ef1493936", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А╨╜╨░╤П ╨┐╤Г╨┤╤А╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "be988adb-e1da-4907-b7b0-c29c6838e630", "name": "╨Ь╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 65, "amount": 65, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "65 ╨│"}, {"id": "5d221acb-bf2a-4ee9-ae65-9413b44d045e", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "6aa9dceb-de3f-4557-a5ad-dd865c049081", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 350, "amount": 350, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "350 ╨│"}, {"id": "023e58e2-93c3-4f39-ba3d-a956ae58a0a1", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "011e3c64-f4c5-4d01-a28e-9d83570ed67d", "name": "╨Т╨░╨╜╨╕╨╗╤М╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤Н╨║╤Б╤В╤А╨░╨║╤В", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "b614f73e-8060-4cfa-875b-64b6e12221ff", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "b6c998b0-7726-4438-b8f5-bbd9a3342e28", "name": "╨У╤Г╤Б╤В╤Л╨╡ ╤Б╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbff168c-afd7-44e8-98cf-111d7e0af483", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id