ake for about 15-20min or until golden. Let cool.\r\n\r\n5\r\nFor the toppings chop the onions and saut├й in a bit of butter, let caramelize, this may take ten to 15 minutes, stir occasionally. Rub the steaks with a bit of garlic and then grill or fry the steaks, the bacon, and eggs with salt and pepper, toast the buns after having cut in half. Spread mustard on one bun half, layer each chivito with steak, a slice of ham, a slice of cheese, one bacon stripe, a tomato slice, and some lettuce. Place fried egg on top and sprinkle generously with chimichurri and some onions right before serving.	1	\N	Uruguayan	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://jennyisbaking.com/2019/06/14/lets-grill-chivito-uruguays-national-dish/#recipe	mealdb:53319	[{"id": "a90e69f1-e336-4226-bcca-01f1947a2e70", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "af3abc86-b265-4d4d-bb39-b39d568aa3f0", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "960f850c-468e-471f-bcc7-719c5ef24ddc", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╤П╤Б", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "abe62cd9-efd7-4251-967f-4b626bc05e30", "originalString": "15 ╨│"}, {"id": "aca390d6-6a40-4b21-9a4d-0949eb63a151", "name": "╨Т╨╛╨┤╨░", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "347cbc11-16c1-446c-b7da-0f7cca25816d", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 450, "amount": 450, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "450 ╨│"}, {"id": "b8d2c525-dedc-42a0-8bba-453eabe28b18", "name": "╨е╨╗╨╡╨▒╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "92d941b4-3c67-4f79-b9f9-cba28a50f756", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "be8bd9dd-acb1-4815-b103-43d2bac9eb27", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "gr