t is tender and the sauce is thickened. Add additional water if your beef curry begins to dry and stick, or if would like your curry to have more of a soupy consistency.\r\nWhen the beef curry is ready, remove from the heat, give it a taste, and adjust the seasonings as desired. Garnish with fresh chilis and cilantro.	1	\N	Kenyan	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://tasteoftheplace.com/kenyan-beef-curry/	mealdb:53112	[{"id": "e207de38-502e-41d3-a457-d5091fe1a47a", "name": "╨Т╨╛╨┤╨░", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 960, "amount": 960, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "960 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "63e662fe-370c-48c2-b9db-777bb056df0f", "name": "╨У╨╛╨▓╤П╨╢╤М╤П ╨▓╤Л╤А╨╡╨╖╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "41643828-db47-4e6d-9ad7-9b56cdacc848", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "d633283f-8b91-4ddc-a3b9-f96f0f6e6d24", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "200 ╨│"}, {"id": "d9970735-e611-4399-9407-e9059065d8a6", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╤В╤Л╨╣ ╨╕╨╝╨▒╨╕╤А╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "06e865f7-d973-40ea-9663-5a108892f112", "originalString": "10 ╨│"}, {"id": "731a1e68-1eda-4d4a-8ffd-aa5c75454a7d", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "11c47778-76aa-497e-9059-1af6915949ba", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨╗╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e90c3874-7702-443d-a509-8a57053c11cc", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "7df15203-b475-475c-b136-99968c2de0ef", "name": "╨Я╨╛╨╝╨╕╨┤╨╛╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "200 ╨│"}, {"id": "fee447ec-3342-4c42-ae7d-cc13ece5a795", "name": "╨Я╨░╨┐╤А╨╕╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "85045806-3a18-4d35-ad01-0230