 ketchup (1/2 cup for 4 servings), and 2 tsp sugar (4 tsp for 4).\r\n\r\n4. Once meatloaves and carrots have baked 20 minutes, remove from oven. Spoon half the ketchup glaze over meatloaves (save\r\nthe rest for serving); return to oven until carrots are browned and tender, meatloaves are cooked through, and glaze is tacky, 4-5 minutes more.\r\n\r\n5. Meanwhile, melt 2 TBSP butter (4 TBSP for 4 servings) in pot used for potatoes over medium heat. Add remaining garlic and cook\r\nuntil fragrant, 30 seconds. Add potatoes and 1/4 tsp wasabi. Mash, adding splashes of reserved potato cooking liquid as necessary until smooth. Season with salt and pepper. (If you like things spicy, stir in more wasabi!)\r\n\r\n6. Divide meatloaves, mashed potatoes, and roasted carrots between plates. Sprinkle with scallion greens and serve with remaining ketchup glaze on the side for dipping.	1	\N	United States	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	\N	mealdb:52992	[{"id": "ef23a976-5f4f-490d-a29a-23765e2e7494", "name": "╨Ъ╨░╤А╤В╨╛╤Д╨╡╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "250 ╨│"}, {"id": "3aa62ecd-bd5c-4a46-8c86-a238dc45df8c", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╤А╨║╨╛╨▓╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 600, "amount": 600, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "600 ╨│"}, {"id": "9c7754d7-1383-45bd-a395-361ef59e8e78", "name": "╨Ч╨╡╨╗╨╡╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨╗╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "980eded5-5322-4538-a611-b44bec4a5543", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "df8f2427-85d5-442e-99c0-51915225ad4f", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "3e82db9e-947b-42b0-a2a2-2bb4f2fd5aae", "name": "╨е╨╗╨╡╨▒", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c91eb3ce-ad08-438e-b020-4408afd585f3", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "902635bc-ab14-47fb-9165-7b15745f9209", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨