il the veggies are tender, about 5 minutes. Add the garlic and a generous pinch of salt and pepper to the pan and cook for 1 minute.  Deglaze the pan with the white wine. Continue to cook until the wine has reduced by half, about 3 minutes. Stir in the milk, heavy cream, and reserved pasta water. Bring the mixture to a gentle boil and allow to simmer and reduce for 2-3 minutes. Turn off the heat and add the Parmesan cheese and cooked pasta. Season with salt and pepper to taste. Garnish with Parmesan cheese and chopped parsley, if desired.	1	\N	Italian	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	\N	mealdb:52796	[{"id": "3604f034-8a70-4963-8773-977aae5b32b7", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "30 ╨│"}, {"id": "4121311c-1334-4ea2-939a-a0ee17a16946", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "45 ╨│"}, {"id": "43275f84-368f-4f63-b99d-131012dd090b", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "fde4920d-1aea-40db-ab56-10941a2d8d85", "originalString": "250 ╨│"}, {"id": "125b0b9f-79f9-4f57-b2fe-f97b84168b3e", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "ac33cf88-38a0-4418-90e9-8c82bf93695a", "name": "╨в╤Л╨║╨▓╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "ad39256c-e83c-4eeb-8cf2-ab1fe320659a", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "7906e235-14b1-40c3-80ab-1634a0dc41d7", "name": "╨С╤А╨╛╨║╨║╨╛╨╗╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "40940631-c1af-481c-8bc1-4e980f1d3a3c", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2e2aaf15-4509-4dbf-8245-f50531f569b3", "name": "╨У╤А╨╕╨▒╤Л", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "97f04ffa-f6a9-4e22-b285-58e2a13b33b0", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "cfe08f87-ea8f-421b-