full. Heat to 170C, or until a cube of bread dropped in browns in 30 seconds. Pipe 12-15cm lengths of dough into the oil, snipping off the end of each one with a pair of scissors as you go. Pipe four or five at a time and cook for around 4 mins, or until golden and crisp, turning them with tongs or a slotted spoon as they cook. Remove from the oil and place on a wire rack. Repeat with the rest of the dough. Leave to cool if reheating later, otherwise roll the churros in the cinnamon sugar and serve immediately with the warm chocolate sauce and ice cream. To reheat the churros, put on a tray and bake for 5-8 mins, then roll in the sugar coating. Meanwhile, warm the sauce in a pan and serve alongside for dipping.	1	\N	Spanish	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/chocolate-churros-with-chocolate-salted-caramel-sauce	mealdb:53170	[{"id": "dd269b7f-8617-4977-8397-1c46b6d0b69b", "name": "╨Я╨╛╨┤╤Б╨╛╨╗╨╜╨╡╤З╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "9c0157c3-cccb-4325-8c3d-5214e3e6b67a", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2881fea0-7695-4e4e-8cee-99f1e64b96b0", "name": "╨б╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "80210c29-dfdb-4f67-b918-002a8aa3f3e1", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "b84798c9-fb88-4f22-989f-a9ce02b85700", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А muscovado", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "11c8d5d1-fce6-472e-ad0b-03817ed118d7", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "781369bd-f056-4f33-8198-59bc7c2a58a5", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "3239d2e4-b8aa-4bc7-b7f1-95e5f35f8029", "name": "╨У╤Г╤Б╤В╤Л╨╡ ╤Б╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbff168c-afd7-44e8-98cf-111d7e0af483", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "eb6927b1-cf72-4bf3-9c5a-c61cc619591b", "name": "╨в╨╡╨╝╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤И╨╛╨║╨╛╨╗╨░╨┤", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50