hallow bowls (this keeps it from getting coated in too much chocolate whilst youтАЩre dipping).\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nDip each lamington in the icing until completely covered. Roll in the coconut and set on a wire rack. Repeat with the remaining sponges. Chill for a minimum of 1 hr.	1	\N	Australian	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/lamingtons	mealdb:53104	[{"id": "42d40348-054c-4a0b-a929-19dd92bf4190", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╨╡╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2c2b5fab-97df-451d-89b2-c0c725035a54", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "461d8f95-aec1-4784-87f6-5f2f3119f063", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А╨╜╨░╤П ╨┐╤Г╨┤╤А╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "3584ee06-284c-48e9-ac4c-10184be00ec2", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "e579ce47-6add-47ee-bb31-f6fc38594b81", "name": "╨Ь╤Г╨║╨░ ╤Б ╤А╨░╨╖╤А╤Л╤Е╨╗╨╕╤В╨╡╨╗╨╡╨╝", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2e0dba19-7842-4b59-afdb-1f9ca1518136", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "c5b40650-d4d8-4aec-9d2c-0cf51d46ff98", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "45 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "8af91a39-426c-47fd-8e0b-c5ae3a3032a7", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "2.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "488bb6ae-43f5-484f-85e5-ae0091e99ab0", "name": "╨У╤Г╤Б╤В╤Л╨╡ ╤Б╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbff168c-afd7-44e8-98cf-111d7e0af483", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "0a9a1307-ac82-4de7-84e4-319e760ac9e2", "name": "╨Т╨░╤А╨╡╨╜╤М╨╡ ╨╕╨╖ ╨╝╨░╨╗╨╕╨╜╤Л", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "db53322a-f1e3-4655-bb68-be6549