ing\r\nтЦв\r\nWhisk together the egg whites and sugar until you get glossy, stiff peaks. The meringue should hold its form тАУ if it still melts continue whisking.\r\nтЦв\r\nSpread out the meringue on top of the cake batter. Use a spatula to form light waves with the meringue. Sprinkle almonds on top of the meringue. Bake for about 30 minutes, until the meringue and almonds are golden.\r\nCream filling\r\nтЦв\r\nWhisk the cream into stiff peaks. Carefully fold in the vanilla custard.\r\nAssembly\r\nтЦв\r\nOnce the cake has cooled, cut it in half. You can use scissors for this, or a knife on a cutting board, slicing through the baking paper as well.\r\nтЦв\r\nPlace half of the cake on a serving platter with the meringue side down and peel off the baking paper.\r\nтЦв\r\nSpread the cream filling across the cake. Then carefully remove the other half of the cake from the baking paper and place it over the cream filling, meringue side up.\r\nтЦв\r\nServe with fresh berries.	1	\N	Norway	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://scandinaviancookbook.com/kvaefjord-cake-verdens-beste-worlds-best-cake/	mealdb:53128	[{"id": "2b72ad11-61e5-405f-a39e-bad8590a9617", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╤И╤В", "grams": 500, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "10 ╤И╤В"}, {"id": "6a585377-aaed-4fa6-8df6-b9864e0a7e1b", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╨║╤Г╤А╤Г╨╖╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨║╤А╨░╤Е╨╝╨░╨╗", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "41137d44-eccd-4d8e-b985-ca171a3b3a50", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "16f5a15a-db31-4655-943a-aad36505bdef", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 600, "amount": 600, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "600 ╨│"}, {"id": "eb1b2dae-01d4-4fc8-a340-c066dd33645f", "name": "╨б╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╕ 33%", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 160, "amount": 160, "ingredientId": "c80d8ffa-f425-4e4d-9bad-6555635f4c2c", "originalString": "160 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "75ecf254-6fbb-453b-8fdb-8097873b29e2", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║