 the air fryer basket and cook for 10 mins, turning halfway through, until it's golden. Toss the cabbage with the mayo and the remaining lemon juice.\r\n\r\nSTEP 5\r\n\r\nSpoon the hummus (or dip of your choice) into the toasted buns, then top with the rocket, chilli chicken, halloumi, and peppers. Drizzle with a little more chilli sauce, spoon over the cabbage, season with black pepper, and top with the bun lids. Serve with any extra cabbage on the side or a green salad.	1	\N	United States	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/15-minute-chicken-halloumi-burgers	mealdb:53085	[{"id": "b1a121ec-2536-4fcf-96d3-8cd81e8e9fa4", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╤А╨╕╨╜╨░╤П ╨│╤А╤Г╨┤╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "12c12878-ea46-4858-9358-8795cf84fcbb", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "ce07b129-f2d4-428a-aaa2-c5a975c9ceb1", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "15 ╨│"}, {"id": "1e5de508-9f10-4457-b9b7-eaa9766912b2", "name": "╨Ю╤Б╤В╤А╤Л╨╣ ╤Б╨╛╤Г╤Б", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "a5314942-dbc6-4e1f-9a73-8fa8f75f0ae9", "originalString": "60 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "a58e4aba-4a80-4266-bbe2-07100ebf8993", "name": "╨Ы╨╕╨╝╨╛╨╜╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╤Б╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3779e3c1-9b78-4f1e-b93b-0c38baafe431", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "83af1cf9-ebca-4ca0-8a7a-d3aa47a35928", "name": "╨С╤Г╨╗╨╛╤З╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "1f99a06e-8d8d-465e-9641-944bf78b7205", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "d9c1eb3b-5a55-4f82-9051-fd8845a0cdcd", "name": "╨б╤Л╤А ╤Е╨░╨╗╨╗╤Г╨╝╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "5459d2d0-5d40-4ba8-a0a4-eede14fb7d3b", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "54d632ea-09a9-4dfe-8023-0c5b190a0c2b", "name": "╨Ъ╨░╨┐╤Г╤Б╤В╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a3ad7e26-0d58-4add-aeda-a27e6a3a5a31", 