 pepper, caraway seeds and cayenne pepper; cook for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nMix in the dried mushrooms, hot pepper sauce, Worcestershire sauce, beef stock, tomato paste and tomatoes. Heat through just until boiling. Pour the vegetables and all of the liquid into the casserole dish with the meat. Cover with a lid.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven for 2 1/2 to 3 hours, until meat is very tender.	1	\N	Polish	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/138131/bigos-hunters-stew/	mealdb:53018	[{"id": "2bea9507-b2a1-46cb-ad3b-955659e588ba", "name": "╨С╨╡╨║╨╛╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "cc12b61c-27b8-4e9a-afbb-355ac954fc21", "name": "╨Ъ╨╕╨╗╨▒╨░╤Б╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d0d2cc07-68d2-4888-b275-dd55aaed291d", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "f2f43e7a-2b3c-46f4-9da6-b0e5bbf9fc79", "name": "╨б╨▓╨╕╨╜╨╕╨╜╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4aeae1ae-8a32-41ea-af48-7828e4bd26a6", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "64de3368-a23a-47bf-a8c1-8c42684f88c8", "name": "╨Ь╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "60 ╨│"}, {"id": "6b882fd9-4380-4efe-9dd2-2aeeca112bbf", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "ba425aa1-1592-4b2e-a71c-0377427d8bca", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "93d2d4b3-b6a1-48af-8012-dc9d593ba6e5", "name": "╨У╤А╨╕╨▒╤Л", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 360, "amount": 360, "ingredientId": "97f04ffa-f6a9-4e22-b285-58e2a13b33b0", "originalString": "360 ╨│"}, {"id": "4e15f034-aba8-4253-bc70-4d9d302d797c", "name": "╨Ъ╨░╨┐╤Г╤Б╤В╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 960, "amount": 960, "ingredientId": "a3a