 splash of cooking liquid if it looks dry. Serve with grated Parmesan, if you like.	1	\N	Italian	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/venetian-duck-ragu	mealdb:52838	[{"id": "5cee3965-f6bd-4356-9803-254cc3d6e075", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "22bc0755-7ce6-4819-8ebf-299e63d6ce66", "name": "╨г╤В╨╕╨╜╤Л╨╡ ╨╜╨╛╨╢╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "dfea1907-cca3-4f16-b790-8cd34b41b84b", "originalString": "200 ╨│"}, {"id": "92756103-b81c-47de-994e-ac65365d4bff", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "8163018a-df8c-4201-8f76-97ab14f4e669", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "771651c8-dd73-4004-9810-eec1e90e47bb", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "10 ╨│"}, {"id": "31938177-522a-4b54-b448-01a9ecde9bca", "name": "╨Я╤И╨╡╨╜╨╕╤З╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "10 ╨│"}, {"id": "7eb796be-42d9-4f85-9b7e-f4661fd15a6f", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨▓╨╕╨╜╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e9a14389-b83b-487a-8d46-ff197ced56a8", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "3fa12d38-9e93-4e33-b6e3-14c779ac6b5f", "name": "╨в╨╛╨╝╨░╤В╤Л ╨╜╨░╤А╨╡╨╖╨░╨╜╨╜╤Л╨╡", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6bb88833-e4c2-4c34-aa82-b8d7869be930", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "9689bf83-b936-4fe8-b4ac-025471f90c22", "name": "╨Ъ╤Г╨▒╨╕╨║ ╨║╤Г╤А╨╕╨╜╨╛╨│╨╛ ╨▒╤Г╨╗╤М╨╛╨╜╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e1dc2130-4