 with a further 2 layers of sauce and pasta, finishing with a layer of pasta.\r\nPut the cr├иme fra├оche in a bowl and mix with 2 tbsp water to loosen it and make a smooth pourable sauce. Pour this over the top of the pasta, then top with the mozzarella. Sprinkle Parmesan over the top and bake for 25тАУ30 mins until golden and bubbling. Serve scattered with basil, if you like.	1	\N	Italian	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/classic-lasagne	mealdb:52844	[{"id": "a625f471-bcfd-4ed9-9059-7dd2ab5a2e2f", "name": "╨Ю╨╗╨╕╨▓╨║╨╛╨▓╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "4ded3576-a620-4f10-94b1-4c1bfede95b1", "name": "╨С╨╡╨║╨╛╨╜", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "6af1f436-2468-4094-b40c-94a79ac590d0", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "b5323450-0a7f-4a96-b4de-7809ccc12f39", "name": "╨б╨╡╨╗╤М╨┤╨╡╤А╨╡╨╣", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a4b7203e-cf47-4297-8829-4be3c7270d19", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "491797bc-761f-47f6-a5c8-90adaf479457", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╤А╨║╨╛╨▓╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "46f5210f-82d4-431e-9425-32acf8843f93", "name": "╨з╨╡╤Б╨╜╨╛╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "93b551f8-429a-4826-9a16-291057d57232", "name": "╨У╨╛╨▓╤П╨╢╨╕╨╣ ╤Д╨░╤А╤И", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "15229283-665a-43f5-8bb0-69faf5749d2f", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "a623fd42-80aa-4d97-afd1-63f5ce823ff4", "name": "╨в╨╛╨╝╨░╤В╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨┐╤О╤А╨╡", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount":