184247a2-1759-4a23-a284-270106b9455f	╨Ы╨╡╤В╨╜╨╕╨╣ ╨┐╤Г╨┤╨╕╨╜╨│	lunch	720	40	22	90	{╨│╨╗╤О╤В╨╡╨╜}	[{"name": "╨Ъ╨╗╤Г╨▒╨╜╨╕╨║╨░", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨Х╨╢╨╡╨▓╨╕╨║╨░", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╨░╤П ╤Б╨╝╨╛╤А╨╛╨┤╨╕╨╜╨░", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨Ь╨░╨╗╨╕╨╜╨░", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А╨╜╨░╤П ╨┐╤Г╨┤╤А╨░", "grams": 50}, {"name": "╨е╨╗╨╡╨▒", "grams": 350}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rsqwus1511640214.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:50.2+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.336+00	[]	Bring out the juices: Wash fruit and gently dry on kitchen paper тАУ keep strawberries separate. Put sugar and 3 tbsp water into a large pan. Gently heat until sugar dissolves тАУ stir a few times. Bring to a boil for 1 min, then tip in the fruit (not strawberries). Cook for 3 mins over a low heat, stirring 2-3 times. The fruit will be softened, mostly intact and surrounded by dark red juice. Put a sieve over a bowl and tip in the fruit and juice.\r\nLine the bowl with cling film and prepare the bread: Line the 1.25-litre basin with cling film as this will help you to turn out the pudding. Overlap two pieces of cling film in the middle of the bowl as itтАЩs easier than trying to get one sheet to stick to all of the curves. Let the edges overhang by about 15cm. Cut the crusts off the bread. Cut 4 pieces of bread in half, a little on an angle, to give 2 lopsided rectangles per piece. Cut 2 slices into 4 triangles each and leave the final piece whole.\r\nBuild the pud: Dip the whole piece of bread into the juice for a few secs just to coat. Push this into the bottom of the basin. Now dip the wonky rectangular pieces one at a time and press around the basinтАЩs sides so that they fit together neatly, alternately placing wide and narrow ends up. If you canтАЩt quite fit the last piece of bread in it doesnтАЩt matter, just trim into a triangle, dip in juice and slot in. Now spoon in the softened fruit, adding the strawberries here and there as you go.\r\nLet flavours mingle then serve: Dip the bread triangles in juice and place on top тАУ trim off overhang with scissors. Keep leftover juice for later. Bring cling film up and loosely seal. Put a side plate on top and weight down with cans. Chill for 6 hrs or overnight. To serve, open out cling film then put a serving plate upside-down on top and flip over. serve with leftover juice, any extra berries and cream.	1	\N	British	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/4516/summer-pudding	mealdb:52889	[{"id": "8ab94fa8-74d6-4f0d-922b-73b0595c9ef9", "name": "╨Ъ╨╗╤Г╨▒╨╜╨╕╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "392f7176-d17d-4013-b8e5-bc415365ac85", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2bfddb33-5cbd-48e9-998d-16cce734a20e", "name": "╨Х╨╢╨╡╨▓╨╕╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "964f0e69-e85c-4bbc-9606-42d8dd560d72", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "52111740-8a8d-41b1-8764-b467ba2a9c66", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╨░╤П ╤Б╨╝╨╛╤А╨╛╨┤╨╕╨╜╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "94db80f3-be35-45bd-9930-7d00359442b7", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "6a1ac428-4ae2-4c2b-88ca-e0974417051f", "name": "╨Ь╨░╨╗╨╕╨╜╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c4212d69-2178-4096-90bb-c452baf41cae", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "074bfdfb-26bd-4599-ad79-e7d336abba73", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А╨╜╨░╤П ╨┐╤Г╨┤╤А╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "18f9a181-7492-4c8a-8bc2-ac33c2c45770", "name": "╨е╨╗╨╡╨▒", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 350, "amount": 350, "ingredientId": "c91eb3ce-ad08-438e-b020-4408afd585f3", "originalString": "350 ╨│"}]	["vegetarian"]
