 the oven and bake for 30 minutes, or until the pastry is golden-brown and cooked through.\r\nFor the green beans, bring a saucepan of salted water to the boil, add the beans and cook for 4-5 minutes, or until just tender.\r\nDrain and toss with the butter, then season with black pepper.\r\nTo serve, place a large spoonful of pie onto each plate with some green beans alongside.	1	\N	British	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/beef_and_mustard_pie_58002	mealdb:52874	[{"id": "e6be5f60-14fb-4578-9eda-68ba2c5537f9", "name": "╨У╨╛╨▓╤П╨┤╨╕╨╜╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6faa9697-3013-4635-a452-09e75c62051a", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "07805471-4f5c-48d8-ba71-f234b4ef8659", "name": "╨Я╤И╨╡╨╜╨╕╤З╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "1848f499-e972-4434-80ed-2cf20273156f", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛ ╤А╨░╨┐╤Б╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "70e5c0be-d63c-4845-bc2a-20f57287c083", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "e2b5224e-4d13-4a3c-8620-6159ad2d20ac", "name": "╨Ъ╤А╨░╤Б╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨▓╨╕╨╜╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e9a14389-b83b-487a-8d46-ff197ced56a8", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "c7fa0b99-54d2-4977-88a5-6cee4e90f129", "name": "╨У╨╛╨▓╤П╨╢╨╕╨╣ ╨▒╤Г╨╗╤М╨╛╨╜", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e4abe98d-da0e-4159-8aed-2ce633951fc1", "originalString": "50 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "78bb22b1-9c82-4d49-8df0-23a156f24793", "name": "╨Ы╤Г╨║", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "ac50591a-6967-4dea-bb55-21f81f4a83a9", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╤А╨║╨╛╨▓╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "69f12a69-363e-43e7-b534-75ed875c1083", "name": "╨в╨╕╨╝╤М╤П╨╜", "unit