h and cut into strips. Place that over the top of the pie in a diamond shaped pattern. Brush the strokes and sides with the other egg yolk and place in the preaheated oven.\r\nBake the apple pie for about 1 hour or until golden and cooked through. Leave to cool in the tin and make sure the sides are loose before opening the tin.	1	\N	Netherlands	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://insimoneskitchen.com/the-best-ever-apple-pie-recipe/#recipe	mealdb:53386	[{"id": "ad40ee4c-a262-4e0c-986d-8f4398b610f3", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "bb5901c1-e0bf-49eb-a180-219af75ea2d6", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨░ (╨╢╨╡╨╗╤В╨║╨╕)", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "541507c6-0b4b-4e50-8f7f-856c4c44ca1a", "originalString": "100 ╨│"}, {"id": "93b21225-853a-4273-862e-c2ea601c7563", "name": "╨Ь╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2f5ffb3d-c496-4579-bd69-3236538da70e", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "a0224850-08de-4ed0-8c87-607191c03fac", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 0.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "0.5 ╨│"}, {"id": "52ac58e5-7124-4e96-8e55-694471c2be1a", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "cf9ce775-b01e-4d46-bf80-08550517e77a", "name": "╨Ш╨╖╤О╨╝", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "61a3303a-7b8b-4af4-a702-8ab5234230db", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "0863958d-864b-4de3-8eca-3c2d168e386b", "name": "╨п╨▒╨╗╨╛╨║╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "86ebb7c3-77fc-48d1-bced-09fa13f95133", "origi