etween each slice. Cover with a tea towel and set aside to rise for 30 minutes.\r\nPreheat oven to 190C/375F/Gas 5.\r\nBake the buns in the oven for 20-25 minutes, or until risen and golden-brown.\r\nMeanwhile, for the glaze, heat the milk and sugar in a saucepan until boiling. Reduce the heat and simmer for 2-3 minutes.\r\nRemove the buns from the oven and brush with the glaze, then set aside to cool on a wire rack.	1	\N	British	["╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╨║╤Г╤Б"]	t	https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/chelsea_buns_95015	mealdb:52898	[{"id": "15b83a79-0e56-477c-a220-d1b0bf10d1b9", "name": "╨Я╤И╨╡╨╜╨╕╤З╨╜╨░╤П ╨╝╤Г╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "500 ╨│"}, {"id": "50f7a130-f978-4740-9c10-b668b8e24d39", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "a926f2ab-f321-434a-9de7-a32ae21ecda6", "name": "╨Ф╤А╨╛╨╢╨╢╨╕", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8173f05b-53c4-4ba6-a714-740bc2534450", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "2d7a02f2-6db3-4cdd-90c1-8d94dc1bd893", "name": "╨Ь╨╛╨╗╨╛╨║╨╛", "unit": "╨╝╨╗", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "150 ╨╝╨╗"}, {"id": "002f8012-b3cc-400b-8fe7-423c649b9b4a", "name": "╨Ь╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "d7d98e89-a189-46ae-854b-eeb19db7d09f", "name": "╨п╨╣╤Ж╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "0ec16882-91db-4a36-a20c-5c2a1042d828", "name": "╨а╨░╤Б╤В╨╕╤В╨╡╨╗╤М╨╜╨╛╨╡ ╨╝╨░╤Б╨╗╨╛", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "6f16e486-5bfe-422b-a987-f835a3d07581", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╤З╨╜╨╡