ith V-rack. Place roasting pan over two burners on stovetop and fill with 1-inch of water. Bring water to a boil over high heat, reduce heat to medium, cover roasting pan with aluminum foil, and steam brisket until an instant read thermometer registers 180 degrees when inserted into thickest part of the meat, 1 to 2 hours, adding more hot water as needed.\r\nTransfer brisket to cutting board and let cool slightly. Slice and serve, preferably on rye with mustard.	1	\N	Canadian	["╤Г╨╢╨╕╨╜"]	t	http://www.meatwave.com/blog/montreal-smoked-meat-recipe	mealdb:52927	[{"id": "4973abd2-8f72-4be1-af5a-2a0d127ecbac", "name": "╨У╨╛╨▓╤П╨┤╨╕╨╜╨░ ╨▒╤А╨╕╤Б╨║╨╡╤В", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bab6293d-7091-4d04-8b27-925786211b95", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "486d03d0-c062-4769-b6e8-54f6e8ed52b1", "name": "╨б╨╛╨╗╤М", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "39b331a6-7b14-45ce-bed4-2c0d45457be6", "name": "╨з╤С╤А╨╜╤Л╨╣ ╨┐╨╡╤А╨╡╤Ж", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "f0e5f8a6-efb8-41db-8bf4-098aea77ef76", "originalString": "150 ╨│"}, {"id": "fda958c5-25ae-41cb-8592-d5a6be71f5d0", "name": "╨Ъ╨╛╤А╨╕╨░╨╜╨┤╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "52d1a2ee-7393-4457-ad02-60b13081000a", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "89eecbac-69c8-47d9-b6c6-8313fa3abf0b", "name": "╨б╨░╤Е╨░╤А", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "50 ╨│"}, {"id": "f54a2425-45ff-4e70-a8f7-070e145271ce", "name": "╨Ы╨░╨▓╤А╨╛╨▓╤Л╨╣ ╨╗╨╕╤Б╤В", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "74796ff2-897a-4931-9396-b51b81fda780", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "764a25c8-0ed9-4f7c-bdbc-8983cc77b329", "name": "╨У╨▓╨╛╨╖╨┤╨╕╨║╨░", "unit": "╨│", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "dfbbaba4-1f1d-40e2-949c-06b7a6a78217", "originalString": "5 ╨│"}, {"id": "60cd7a80